    "assessment": "The public endpoint provides a reliable standard WFS ResourceID protocol through both WFS 2 KVP GET and FES 2 POST. A gml:id readback returns the known component and exactly reproduces the already retained 34-vertex EPSG:3067 polygon. Both ResourceID forms return a successful empty FeatureCollection for one synthetic native-shaped ID. Use the gml:id-shaped component key as the query locator and preserve the INSPIRE namespace+localId URI as the canonical external component identity. The generic FES property filter cannot address cp:inspireId/base:localId or namespace in this service. The earlier advertised GetFeatureById stored-query HTTP 404 for both IDs remains inconclusive and is not a geometry-absence result.",
